% Commentary Sources page
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.5cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 研讀資源 Study Resources}

\vspace{0.5cm}

\fcolorbox{ChapterBlue}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.5in}
\vspace{0.3cm}
{\normalsize\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} John MacArthur 約翰·麥克阿瑟}\\[0.3em]
\small\color{TextGray}
教會傳統與不少研究者將路加視為外邦作者；他強調耶穌是全人類的救主。耶穌對「被遺棄者」——外邦人、撒瑪利亞人、婦女、兒童、稅吏、罪人——展現特別的憐憫。路加特別記載耶穌的禱告生活和聖靈的工作。從9:51開始的十章敘述耶穌往耶路撒冷的旅程，強調祂「堅定面向」十字架。\\[0.5em]
{\footnotesize\itshape Church tradition and many scholars identify Luke as a Gentile author. He emphasizes Jesus as the universal Savior and shows compassion for outcasts—Gentiles, Samaritans, women, children, tax collectors, sinners. The journey to Jerusalem (9:51-19:27) stresses Jesus' steady progression toward the cross.}
\vspace{0.3cm}
\end{minipage}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\fcolorbox{CommentaryBrown}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.5in}
\vspace{0.3cm}
{\normalsize\bfseries\color{CommentaryBrown} G. Campbell Morgan 乾伯·摩根}\\[0.3em]
\small\color{TextGray}
路加福音展現「完美的人子」——耶穌是完全的人，經歷人類所有的軟弱卻沒有犯罪。四首頌歌（馬利亞頌、撒迦利亞頌、天使頌、西面頌）構成獨特的開場，充滿舊約詩篇的迴響。路加特別關注禱告：耶穌在每個重要時刻都禱告——受洗、揀選門徒、登山變像、十字架上。\\[0.5em]
{\footnotesize\itshape Luke presents the perfect Son of Man—fully human yet sinless. The four canticles (Magnificat, Benedictus, Gloria, Nunc Dimittis) echo the Psalms. Luke emphasizes prayer: Jesus prayed at His baptism, before choosing disciples, at the Transfiguration, and on the cross.}
\vspace{0.3cm}
\end{minipage}
}

\vspace{0.5cm}

{\small\color{TextGray}
\textbf{路加福音獨有材料 Unique to Luke:}\\
好撒瑪利亞人 (10:30-37) · 浪子回頭 (15:11-32) · 財主與拉撒路 (16:19-31)\\
十個痲瘋病人 (17:11-19) · 撒該 (19:1-10) · 以馬忤斯路上 (24:13-35)\\
馬利亞與馬大 (10:38-42) · 法利賽人與稅吏 (18:10-14)
}
\end{center}
